# `KEYWORD-RENAME-SCOPE`: the gate cuts BOTH ways. `flowline` is 0.2 vocabulary, so writing it in
# a document that declares 0.1 is a line error NAMING THE VERSION — the same
# shape as `genre "statechart" requires figdown 0.2`. Two spellings inside ONE
# version is a SPELLING VARIANT, which SYNTAX-STYLE RULE 5 forbids; two spellings
# across VERSIONS is ordinary language evolution, each version accepting one.
figdown 0.1 flowchart
process a "Step"
process b "Step 2"
flowline a -> b
